{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-32","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"physics","number":32,"points":null,"unitId":"physics-electro","unitLabel":"전기·자기","topic":"전위","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-electro"],"stem":"그림(가)는전기쌍극자를나타낸것이다. 여기에서전기쌍극자\n중심으로부터의거리가r 이고전기쌍극자방향과의각이θ 인곳\n에서의전위V(r, θ )는r 이전기쌍극자의크기에비하여매우클\n때, r 2에반비례하고cosθ 에비례한다.\n(가)\n그림(나)는평면에있는동일한전기쌍극자들이같은간격으로\n배열되어있는것을나타낸것이다. 이때전기쌍극자의중심은\n원둘레위에있다.\n(나)\n원의중심으로부터같은거리에있는세점P, Q, R 중에서전위가\n높은곳부터낮은곳으로순서대로바르게나열한것은?\n(단, 그림(나)에서두점선은서로수직이며원의중심을지난다.)","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"P, Q, R","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"Q, P, R","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"Q, R, P","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"R, P, Q","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"R, Q, P","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":235,"height":290,"region":0,"bbox":[124.355,95.388,94.0,116.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-32/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":651,"height":498,"region":0,"bbox":[33.955,312.188,260.4,199.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-32/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[429.645,151.412,758.256,800.863],"width":328.611,"height":649.451,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[124.355,95.388,94.0,116.0],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[33.955,312.188,260.4,199.2],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"32. 그림(가)는전기쌍극자를나타낸것이다. 여기에서전기쌍극자","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"32.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.282,11.995],"origin":[5.0,14.596],"size":